@startuml get-manager-auth-me
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/auth/me
caption CRB-35 · 현재 매니저 정보. role은 DB의 현재 값

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ManagerAuthController" as Controller

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/auth/me\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Controller: me(manager)
note right of Controller: 가드가 읽은 ManagerContext를 그대로 반환 (추가 조회 없음)
Controller --> Client: 200 { email, role }

@enduml
